# Live mode: copy to .env.local (git ignores it) and fill in from the Supabase dashboard (DEPLOY.md step 1).
# Leave both empty for demo mode (localStorage, no sign-in), which is what CI builds.
# The anon / publishable key is public by design; row-level security protects the data.
# Never put the service_role / secret key here or anywhere else in the frontend.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
